  "nl_text": "The rschema_0249 database is used to store information about users, tourist attractions, carousels, comments, and city honors. The user table contains information about each user, including their email, password, user ID, and username. The tourist_attraction table contains information about each tourist attraction, including its attraction ID, name, category, description, image URL, and location. The carousel table contains information about each carousel, including its carousel ID and image URL. The comment table contains information about each comment, including its content, comment ID, creation time, and user ID. The city_honor table contains information about each city honor, including its attraction ID, honor ID, title, description, and creation time. The user ID in the comment table is a foreign key that references the user ID in the user table, and the attraction ID in the city_honor table is a foreign key that references the attraction ID in the tourist_attraction table.",
  "gold_question": "A website provides travel information and user comment functionality. Users can register accounts, leaving details such as username, password, email, and other information. Users can post comments that include the content of the message and the time of posting. The website displays various tourist attractions, including the name, description, location, image URL, and category of each attraction. Each tourist attraction may receive some honors, which include a title and description. Additionally, the website features a carousel functionality that displays some images. The details of the images include the image ID, image URL, and creation time.",
  "input_json": "/data/RSchema_ExpResults4/Experiment2/schema2text_codellama13b/0249.json",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0249\nCREATE TABLE `user` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `email` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `password` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `username` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `tourist_attraction` (\n  `attraction_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `category` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `description` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `image_url` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `location` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`attraction_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `carousel` (\n  `carousel_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `image_url` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`carousel_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `comment` (\n  `comment_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `content` text NOT NULL,\n  `creation_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`comment_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `comment_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `city_honor` (\n  `honor_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `attraction_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `title` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `description` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `creation_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`honor_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `city_honor_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`attraction_id`) REFERENCES `tourist_attraction` (`attraction_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
